  "title": "Jerre&#39;s Black Bean and Pork Tenderloin Slow Cooker Chili",
  "description": "Tender pork and black beans stew all day in your slow cooker. Just combine the ingredients, set the cooker to low, and 8 to 10 hours later enjoy a rich and delicious chili.",
